<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Volodymyr | AP CS Portfolio</title>
    <style>
        /* Modern Reset and CSS Variables */
        :root {
            --bg-color: #0d1117;
            --surface-color: #161b22;
            --border-color: #30363d;
            --text-main: #c9d1d9;
            --text-muted: #8b949e;
            --accent-color: #58a6ff;
            --accent-glow: rgba(88, 166, 255, 0.15);
            --font-stack: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        body {
            background-color: var(--bg-color);
            color: var(--text-main);
            font-family: var(--font-stack);
            line-height: 1.6;
            padding: 2rem 1rem;
        }

        /* Container Layout */
        .portfolio-container {
            max-width: 750px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        /* Header Layout */
        header {
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            padding-bottom: 2rem;
            margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #ffffff;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
            letter-spacing: -0.5px;
        }

        .subtitle {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            color: var(--accent-color);
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        /* Section Global Rules */
        section {
            margin-bottom: 3rem;
        }

        h2 {
            font-size: 1.4rem;
            color: #ffffff;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.5rem;
        }

        p {
            color: var(--text-main);
            font-size: 1.05rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        /* Tech Badges */
        .skills-grid {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 0.5rem;
            margin-top: 1rem;
        }

        .badge {
            background-color: var(--surface-color);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            color: var(--text-main);
            padding: 0.25rem 0.75rem;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            font-family: monospace;
        }

        /* Projects Layout */
        .project-card {
            background-color: var(--surface-color);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 1.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
            transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;
        }

        .project-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            border-color: var(--accent-color);
            box-shadow: 0 4px 20px var(--accent-glow);
        }

        .project-title {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            color: #ffffff;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        /* Links and Anchors */
        .btn-link {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            color: var(--accent-color);
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 500;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            margin-top: 0.5rem;
        }

        .btn-link:hover {
            text-decoration: underline;
        }

        /* Footer Layout */
        footer {
            border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            padding-top: 1.5rem;
            text-align: center;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 0.85rem;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="portfolio-container">
        
        <!-- Header -->
        <header>
            <h1>Volodymyr</h1>
            <div class="subtitle">AP Computer Science Student & Developer</div>
        </header>

        <!-- About Me Section -->
        <section id="about">
            <h2>About Me</h2>
            <p>
                Hi there! I am a high school student deeply passionate about programming, software engineering, and computational logic. Currently immersed in AP Computer Science, I spend my time exploring algorithms, structural system designs, and building clean code architectures. 
            </p>
            <p>
                I enjoy transforming abstract logic challenges into tangible, functional applications. When I'm not studying or debugging, I'm usually exploring open-source repositories or working on personal development projects.
            </p>
            
            <div class="skills-grid">
                <span class="badge">Java</span>
                <span class="badge">Object-Oriented Programming</span>
                <span class="badge">Data Structures</span>
                <span class="badge">Algorithms</span>
                <span class="badge">HTML5 / CSS3</span>
                <span class="badge">Git / GitHub</span>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Projects Section -->
        <section id="projects">
            <h2>Featured Projects</h2>
            
            <div class="project-card">
                <div class="project-title">AP CS Lab Portfolios & Repository</div>
                <p>A structured compilation of fundamental algorithms, logic puzzles, and core object-oriented projects completed throughout my academic coursework.</p>
                <a href="https://github.com/VTGTHB/VTGTHB.github.io" class="btn-link" target="_blank">View GitHub Repository &rarr;</a>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Footer -->
        <footer>
            <p>&copy; 2026 Volodymyr. Built with HTML & CSS.</p>
        </footer>

    </div>

</body>
</html>
